    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Header action\nAction with header parameters\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/headerAction\nAuthorization: \nX-Request-Id: \nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=\n\n### Security action\nAction with security\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/securityAction\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\ndata=\n\n### Deprecated action\nUse newAction instead\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/deprecatedAction\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nold=\n\n### Multi response action\nAction with multiple responses\nGET {{host}}/v1/extended/multiResponseAction?id=\n\n### Nested input action\nAction with nested inputs\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/nestedInputAction\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"address\": {},\n    \"tags\": []\n}\n\n### Format action\nAction with format specifiers\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/formatAction\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nemail=&bigId=\n\n### Enum action\nAction with enum values\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/enumAction\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nstatus=&role=\n\n### Model ref action\nAction with model references\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/modelRefAction\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n[]\n\n### Default example action\nAction with defaults and examples\nGET {{host}}/v1/extended/defaultExampleAction?page=3&perPage=50\n\n### File upload action\nAction with file upload\nPOST {{host}}/v1/extended/fileUploadAction\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary\n\n--boundary\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"avatar\"; filename=\"avatar\"\n\n< ./path/to/avatar\n--boundary\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"name\"\n\n\n--boundary--\n\n### Optional output action\nAction with required and optional output fields\nGET {{host}}/v1/extended/optionalOutputAction?id=\n",
    "markdown": "# Extended API\nAPI with extended OpenAPI features (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [extended](#extended)\n\n## extended\n\n### Header action\nAction with header parameters\n\n`POST /v1/extended/headerAction`\n\n**Headers:**\n\n| Name | Required | Description |\n|------|----------|-------------|\n| `Authorization` | Yes | Bearer token |\n| `X-Request-Id` | No | Request ID |\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | User name |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Security action\nAction with security\n\n`POST /v1/extended/securityAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `data` | string | Yes | Some data |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### ~~Deprecated action\nUse newAction instead~~ (deprecated)\n\n`POST /v1/extended/deprecatedAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `old` | string | Yes | Old param |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Multi response action\nAction with multiple responses\n\n`GET /v1/extended/multiResponseAction`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | User ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — UserResponse\n- `422` — ValidationError\n\n---\n\n### Nested input action\nAction with nested inputs\n\n`POST /v1/extended/nestedInputAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `address` | object | Yes | Address object |\n| `tags` | array | Yes | Tags array |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Format action\nAction with format specifiers\n\n`POST /v1/extended/formatAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `email` | string | Yes | Email address |\n| `bigId` | integer | Yes | Big ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Enum action\nAction with enum values\n\n`POST /v1/extended/enumAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `status` | string | Yes | Status |\n| `role` | string | No | Role |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Model ref action\nAction with model references\n\n`POST /v1/extended/modelRefAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Default example action\nAction with defaults and examples\n\n`GET /v1/extended/defaultExampleAction`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `page` | integer | No | Page number |\n| `perPage` | integer | No | Items per page |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### File upload action\nAction with file upload\n\n`POST /v1/extended/fileUploadAction`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `multipart/form-data`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `avatar` | file | Yes | User avatar |\n| `name` | string | Yes | User name |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Optional output action\nAction with required and optional output fields\n\n`GET /v1/extended/optionalOutputAction`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | User ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Extended API\nAPI with extended OpenAPI features (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Header action\nAction with header parameters\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Authorization: \" \\\n  -H \"X-Request-Id: \" \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/headerAction\"\n\n# Security action\nAction with security\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Authorization: ${TOKEN}\" \\\n  -d \"data=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/securityAction\"\n\n# Deprecated action\nUse newAction instead\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"old=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/deprecatedAction\"\n\n# Multi response action\nAction with multiple responses\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/multiResponseAction?id=\"\n\n# Nested input action\nAction with nested inputs\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"address\":{},\"tags\":[]}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/nestedInputAction\"\n\n# Format action\nAction with format specifiers\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"email=\" \\\n  -d \"bigId=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/formatAction\"\n\n# Enum action\nAction with enum values\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"status=\" \\\n  -d \"role=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/enumAction\"\n\n# Model ref action\nAction with model references\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '[]' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/modelRefAction\"\n\n# Default example action\nAction with defaults and examples\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/defaultExampleAction?page=3&perPage=50\"\n\n# File upload action\nAction with file upload\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -F \"avatar=@./path/to/avatar\" \\\n  -F \"name=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/fileUploadAction\"\n\n# Optional output action\nAction with required and optional output fields\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/extended/optionalOutputAction?id=\"\n",
